><td>1 (Reference)</td></tr><tr><td>&#x000a0;&#x000a0;&#x000a0;&#x000a0;6&#x02013;3</td><td>628</td><td>31</td><td>(4.9)</td><td>0.86 (0.53&#x02013;1.39)</td></tr><tr><td>&#x000a0;&#x000a0;&#x000a0;&#x000a0;2&#x02013;0</td><td>260</td><td>41</td><td>(15.8)</td><td>2.59 (1.61&#x02013;4.16)&#x02020;</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><p>CI = Confidence interval, OR = odds ratio, COPD = chronic obstructive pulmonary disease, CIRS = Cumulative Illness Rating Scale, HAMT = Hodkinson Abbreviated Mental Test, GDS = Geriatric Depression Scale</p><p>*<italic>Adjusted for age and IADL preadmission functional status</italic></p><p>&#x02020;<italic>P&#x02009;&#x0003c;&#x02009;.1</italic></p></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="Tab3"><label>Table&#x000a0;3</label><caption><p>Multivariable Logistic Regression Analyses Predicting New BADL Disability at Hospital Discharge</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th rowspan="2">Variables</th><th>Full model</th><th rowspan="2"><italic>P</italic> value</th><th>Most parsimonious model*</th><th rowspan="2"><italic>P</italic> value</th><th>Bootstrap estimation</th></tr><tr><th>OR (95% CI)</th><th>OR (95% CI)</th><th>95% CI</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Age</td><td/><td/><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td>&#x000a0;&#x000a0;65&#x02013;74</td><td>1 (Reference)</td><td>&#x02013;</td><td>1 (Reference)</td><td>&#x02013;</td><td/></tr><tr><td>&#x000a0;&#x000a0;75&#x02013;84</td><td>1.76 (1.01&#x02013;3.07)</td><td>0.046</td><td>1.94 (1.12&#x02013;3.34)</td><td>0.017</td><td>(1.06&#x02013;3.36)</td></tr><tr><td>&#x000a0;&#x000a0;&#x02265;84</td><td>2.24 (1.21&#x02013;4.16)</td><td>0.010</td><td>2.75 (1.52&#x02013;4.97)</td><td>0.001</td><td>(1.44&#x02013;4.76)</td></tr><tr><td>Nursing home resident</td><td>4.50 (1.68&#x02013;12.1)</td><td>0.003</td><td>4.75 (1.80&#x02013;12.6)</td><td>0.002</td><td>(1.15&#x02013;13.3)</td></tr><tr><td>&#x000a0;&#x000a0;BMI</td><td/><td/><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td>&#x000a0;&#x000